n initiative. The pair of 2s is unbeatable by any non-bomb pair, so more likely to force pass/bomb.  \n\nGiven that, the **pair of 2s** seems best: forces landlord to spend a bomb early or give initiative to my teammate.  \n\n**Reason:**  \n- It’s a free play, so maximizing pressure is key.  \n- Pair of 2s is the strongest pair possible, almost guaranteeing control shifts unless landlord bombs.  \n- Keeping the pair of 10s in hand provides a future medium-strength pair after using 2s.  \n- Playing a low single wastes free play opportunity and lets landlord dictate later.  \n\n**Answer:**  \n{"cards": ["♠2", "♥2"]}'}
